  "prefLabel": "Asb 203.03 Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Asb 203.03 \"Hearing\" means a publicly noticed meeting pursuant to RSA 541-A:6, for the purpose of the receipt by the board of information, documentation or oral or written testimony, or any combination of these, for the purpose of rulemaking.\n\nSource. #7863-A, eff 3-31-03",
